  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tukule - Cash to Capability Women&#x2019;s Transformative Livelihoods Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen a sustainable, locally led social protection system to break the cycle of poverty for women in Zambia through a structured SHG approach. While a program like this can scale to be as small or large as there is budget for, we have proposed the program design and research objectives that we believe drive the most value in the Zambian context and are achievable. Further discussion and refining the learning objectives will allow for a more specific budget estimate.</narrative>
  </description>
